{"id":"betrachtet","lemma":"betrachtet","pos":"adj","rank":2708,"glosses":["considered, regarded"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/De-betrachtet.ogg/De-betrachtet.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Dieses Problem verdient es, betrachtet zu werden.","en":"This problem deserves considering.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"problem"},{"g":"deserved"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Betrachtet euch als meine Gefangenen!","en":"Consider yourselves my prisoners.","words":[null,{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"caught","l":"gefangen"}]},{"text":"Es wird als Grauzone betrachtet.","en":"It is regarded as a grey area.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"gray area or twilight…"},null]},{"text":"Die Erde ist vom All aus betrachtet wunderschön.","en":"Seen from space, the earth is very beautiful.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"earth"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"from the"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"out of / from"},null,{"g":"gorgeous"}]},{"text":"Im nachhinein betrachtet, war es ein Fehler.","en":"In hindsight, this was a mistake.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"fault, error, mistake"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"afterwards"]]}]}